---
title: "claimComp (Compound V2: Comptroller)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_get_markets: markets = getAllMarkets() or specified cTokens
    q_get_markets --> q_iter: for each market in markets
    q_iter --> q_update_supply: updateCompSupplyIndex(market)
    q_update_supply --> q_distribute_supply: distributeSupplierComp(market, holder)
    q_distribute_supply --> q_update_borrow: updateCompBorrowIndex(market)
    q_update_borrow --> q_distribute_borrow: distributeBorrowerComp(market, holder)
    q_distribute_borrow --> q_iter: next market
    q_iter --> q_transfer: all markets processed
    q_transfer --> q_check_balance: compAccrued = compAccrued[holder]
    q_check_balance --> q_zero_accrued: compAccrued == 0
    q_zero_accrued --> [*]: return (no transfer needed)
    q_check_balance --> q_do_transfer: compAccrued > 0
    q_do_transfer --> q_transfer_fail: COMP.transfer(holder, compAccrued) fails
    q_transfer_fail --> [*]: return (COMP remains accrued for later claim)
    q_do_transfer --> q_success: transfer succeeds
    q_success --> [*]: compAccrued[holder] = 0; emit DistributedSupplierComp; emit DistributedBorrowerComp

    note right of q_update_supply
        INV-001: COMP distribution proportional to share of supply/borrow
        INV-002: compSpeed determines COMP per block per market
    end note

    note right of q_transfer
        INV-003: Failed COMP transfer does not revert; accrued amount preserved
        INV-004: User can claim across all markets or specific markets
    end note
